mapping "b2152.1" source="b2152" target="SNOMED_CT:312024006" relationship=equivalent {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b2152 SNOMED CT 312024006 = ICF functions of the external (extraocular) muscles of the eye,
        i.e. the muscles that execute eye movement/oculomotor control. Target SNOMED CT 4207030 (sctid
        312024006) =, active. Exact functional equivalence: the EOMs' function IS oculomotor control;
        the SNOMED CT concept denotes the function those muscles perform. High tier rather than : strong
        functional identity but not a literal term-for-term match (ICF names the muscles, SNOMED CT names
        the control function they produce); no independent crosswalk. (31763002) is the movement-itself
        concept and a weaker fit than the function concept.
        """
}
mapping "b2153.1" source="b2153" target="SNOMED_CT:363978004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b2153 SNOMED CT 363978004 = ICF functions of the lacrimal (tear) glands — i.e. tear
        production / lacrimation. Target SNOMED CT 4237873 (sctid 363978004) =, active.
